# Skyborne, any class. From the Skyborne Mage route's segment 02: same quests, order, bind and loops. It had no class quest.
# Changed 2026-11-12 for the any-class route: the two TRAIN steps in Shen'dar Village are generic and list the class
# trainers the data has there (research/json/baked_npcs.json; Alliance or both-faction spawns only; no arrow);
# fight hints are class-neutral (Novice Seers, Vulgara, Stormcallers).
# Shen'dar Village sits in the middle of the west half of Zephras Isle.
# Alliance (High Order) versions of the village quests, from ForeverChanges: 93461 Welcome to Shen'dar Village,
# 92596 The High Order and 94413 A Magical Affront (Rathiril Sunlance). TUGs' Alliance file lists the Horde
# versions (92514, 92595, 94411); if Aonda or Rathiril offer something else, take what they offer.
# Changed 2026-11-11 after the first play-through: loop 1's quests are handed in when the route passes back through
# the village on the way to the bandits (before, everything waited for the hearth after loop 2), and the class trainer
# in the village is a real stop.
# 93318 WANTED: Vulgara the Insatiable: flagged elite, but she is level 8 and was soloed at level 7 in play.
# Skipped: 97971 Camping 101: Skinning (needs Skinning 20).
# Carry-out: 92701 To Valanaar, 93948 Deliver the Signet (both handed in at Valanaar, next segment).

