# --- Loop 1: west and south-west ---
C 94413 | Windshaper Novice Seers stand in the hills just west of the village: kill 6. They are casters: pull one at a time, get on top of them and kill them fast (interrupt or stun their casts if your class can)
C 92515 | Prideclaws (the big cats) roam the same western hills: collect 10 pelts
C 92516,93951,92553 | South-west of the village are the hippogryph nesting grounds: kill 8 Hippogryph Youths, 6 Protectors and the Matriarch, and pick up 8 Hippogryph Down feathers from the ground around the nests. Striders in the same fields drop Strider Meat (8) and the nests and striders give Small Eggs (3)
C 93318 @ Zephras Isle, 42.7, 52.8 | Vulgara the Insatiable (8, elite) sits on a hilltop just north of the nesting grounds, south-west of the village. Last fight of this loop: clear the animals around the hill first, eat to full health and use every cooldown or potion you have. If you are below half health while she is still above half, run and press Skip

# --- Back through the village: hand in loop 1 ---
T 92516 | Walk back north-east into Shen'dar Village: Teeri Wellwind, west of the lodge
T 92515 | Indari Sunseam, next to her
T 93951 | Taleen Shimmerthread, next to them
T 92553 | Zerril Softbreeze, the cook, on the west side of the village
T 94413 | Rathiril Sunlance, in the lodge
T 93318 @ Zephras Isle, 45.2, 45.2 | Danarii Bellowveil, beside the constable in the lodge: Vulgara's head
TRAIN | Shen'dar Village: visit your class trainer and learn your level 6 skills, and 8 if you are 8 already. Trainers here, in and around the lodge: warriors Corsan Earthrazer (45.0, 45.1), mages Shenaan Spellwind (45.1, 45.9), druids Naeluna Swiftmend (45.2, 44.2), hunters Elayaa Easewind (45.3, 44.2), rogues Miriaan Mistblade (43.2, 43.3, by the inn). If your class has no trainer here, train in Stormwind
N Sell and repair in the village | Your bags are full of pelts, feathers and meat leftovers. The bandits are next

# --- Loop 2: the bandit cave ---
C 92517,93319 | Leave the village to the north-east: Highlands Bandits camp around a waterfall. Kill 10 and loot 10 Pilfered Windstones from them. Their leader "Badwind" Bennic is in the cave behind the waterfall: clear the bandits near him first
H Shen'dar Village | Or walk back south-west; it is not far
T 92517 | Constable Aonda
T 93319 | Teeri Wellwind

