C 93927 @ Zephras Isle, 41.0, 64.3 | Then kill Skypriest Aanders just south of the tower and loot Raani's Lucky Feather and the Shadowsong Family Signet
C 92550,92551 | Falaath Village, east of the tower: kill 6 Al'Aketh Stormcallers and 4 Living Lightning, take Commander Cyclas's head, and open 10 Stolen Shen'dar Supplies crates around the ruins. The Stormcallers cast lightning: pull them one at a time and eat and drink between pulls
